### List all pages
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages

### Get specific page
GET {{apiUrl}}/pages/getting-started

### Create new page
POST {{apiUrl}}/pages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Getting Started",
  "content": "# Getting Started\n\nWelcome to Schist! This is your first wiki page.\n\n## What is Schist?\n\nSchist is a lightweight, self-hosted markdown wiki.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Create more pages\n2. Link pages together with [[Page Links]]\n3. Organize your knowledge\n\nHappy writing! 📝"
}

### Update existing page
PUT {{apiUrl}}/pages/getting-started
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Getting Started - Updated",
  "content": "# Getting Started - Updated\n\nWelcome to Schist! This page has been updated.\n\n## Features\n\n- Markdown editing\n- Wiki-style linking\n- Full-text search\n- File-based storage\n\n## Links\n\nCheck out [[Project Ideas]] for inspiration."
}

### Delete page
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/pages/getting-started